@startuml Онбординг клиента — manual review path
title Manual review path (продолжение happy path с момента ответа KYC)
scale 2

participant "Onboarding\nService" as svc
database "Onboarding DB" as db_svc
participant "KYC\n(внешний)" as kyc
queue "Kafka" as bm
actor "Менеджер" as mgr
participant "Core Banking" as bk
participant "Notification\nService" as ns
database "Notification DB\n(Notification)" as db_ns

note over svc, kyc
  Продолжение happy path:
  клиент уже получил 202 Accepted,
  status=PENDING
end note

kyc -> bm: publish "VERIFICATION_COMPLETED"\n{applicationId, verdict=manual_review}
bm ->> svc: consume "VERIFICATION_COMPLETED"
activate svc
svc -> db_svc: INSERT KYC_Result (verdict=manual_review, reason_code)
svc -> db_svc: UPDATE Application status=MANUAL_REVIEW
deactivate svc

note over mgr
  Интерфейс менеджера — вне скоупа MVP,
  показан только как источник решения
end note

alt approve
  mgr -> svc: POST /application/{id}/approve\nBearerAuth: <JWT>
  activate svc
  svc -> db_svc: INSERT Application_history\n(changed_by=managerId из BearerAuth)
  svc -> db_svc: UPDATE Application status=APPROVED
  svc -> bm: publish "APPROVED"\n{applicationId}
  deactivate svc

  bm ->> bk: consume "APPROVED"
  note over bk
    далее — идентично happy path:
    создание счёта, ACCOUNT_CREATED,
    COMPLETED, Notification
  end note

else request-additional-info
  mgr -> svc: POST /application/{id}/request-additional-info\nBearerAuth: <JWT>\n{reasonCode, requestedFields, requestedDocuments}
  activate svc
  svc -> db_svc: INSERT Application_history\n(changed_by=managerId из BearerAuth)
  svc -> db_svc: UPDATE Application status=ADDITIONAL_INFO_REQUIRED\n(requested_fields, requested_documents,\nadditional_info_deadline,\ntext_info_received=false, documents_received=false)
  svc -> bm: publish "ADDITIONAL_INFO_REQUESTED"\n{applicationId}
  deactivate svc

  bm ->> ns: consume "ADDITIONAL_INFO_REQUESTED"
  activate ns
  ns -> db_ns: INSERT Notification (status=PENDING)
  ns -> ns: отправка push/email/sms
  ns -> db_ns: UPDATE Notification status=SENT
  deactivate ns

  note over svc
    Донесение данных клиентом (POST .../additional-info,
    POST .../documents с Access-Token) и автопереход
    в EXPIRED по additionalInfoDeadline (ADR-003) —
    отдельная диаграмма, не в этом файле
  end note
end

@enduml